OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners feel 'powerless' over
OL,4,Ahuge solar farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners speaking at a series of
OL,7,Fopen floor hearings on the future of a
OL,8,F2,700-acre (about 1,000-hectare) solar
OL,9,Ffarm say they feel powerless and
OL,10,Fdismissed.
OL,12,FSix months of hearings began on Tuesday
OL,13,Fon the future of the East Pye solar
OL,14,Ffarm which, if approved, would be built
OL,15,Fon land near Long Stratton in Norfolk
OL,16,Fand would generate enough power for
OL,17,F115,000 homes.
OL,19,FDeveloper Island Green Power (IGP),
OL,20,Fsaid the solar farm would help the UK
OL,21,Freduce its carbon emission and meet net
OL,22,Fzero targets.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
