OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners feel 'powerless' over
OL,4,Ahuge solar farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Sandra Mullet, who lives in Great
OL,7,FMoulton, said: "There is a genuine
OL,8,Fsense of grief and fear in our
OL,9,Fcommunities. You have made us feel
OL,10,Fpowerless, but we are not - and we
OL,11,Fshould not - be dismissed as such."
